#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Was möchtest du machen?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_TITLE:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "Что вы хотите сделать?"

#. ja: カンパニー製作手帳
#. de: Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaftsprojekt beginnen
#. fr: Consulter le carnet d'artisanat de compagnie
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_CC_NOTE:1"
msgid "View company crafting log."
msgstr "Открыть журнал рецептов компании."

#. ja: 素材を納品する（品質：<num $n1>/100）
#. de: Materialien abliefern (Qualität: <num $n1>/100)
#. fr: Fournir des matériaux (Qualité<nbsp>: <num $n1>/100)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_CC_SUPPLY:1"
msgid "Contribute materials. (Quality: <num $n1>/100)"
msgstr "Сдать материалы (качество: <num $n1>/100)"

#. ja: 製作を中止する
#. de: Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaftsprojekt abbrechen
#. fr: Interrompre un projet de con<shy>struc<shy>tion
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_CC_BREAK:1"
msgid "Discontinue project."
msgstr "Прекратить выпуск проекта."

#. ja: アイテムを受け取る
#. de: Produkt entgegennehmen
#. fr: Récupérer un projet terminé
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_CC_GET_ITEM:1"
msgid "Collect finished product."
msgstr "Забрать готовый продукт."

#. ja: 作業工程を進捗させる（品質：<num $n1>/100）
#. de: Arbeitsschritt ausführen (Qualität: <num $n1>/100)
#. fr: Faire progresser un projet de con<shy>struc<shy>tion (Qualité<nbsp>: <num $n1>/100)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_CC_PROGRESS:1"
msgid "Advance to the next phase of production. (Quality: <num $n1>/100)"
msgstr "Перейти к следующему этапу производства (качество: <num $n1>/100)"

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を完成させる（品質：<num $n2>/100）
#. de: Herstellung <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 2 1> abschließen (Qualität: <num $n2>/100)
#. fr: Terminer la con<shy>struc<shy>tion <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1> (Qualité<nbsp>: <num $n2>/100)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_CC_LAST_PROGRESS:1"
msgid "Complete the construction of <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>. (Quality: <num $n2>/100)"
msgstr "Завершить производство: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> (качество: <num $n2>/100)"

#. ja: やめる
#. de: Nichts
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_MENU_EXIT:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Ничего."

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」の製作を中止します。<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>途中まで納品していた素材は全て消滅し、<br>アイテムに戻すことはできません。<br></ui-edge-color></ui-color>本当によろしいですか？
#. de: Die Herstellung <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 2 1> wirklich abbrechen?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Die bisher abgelieferten Materialien gehen verloren.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Vous allez interrompre la con<shy>struc<shy>tion <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1>. Confirmer<nbsp>?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>* La progression et les matériaux utilisés seront perdus.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_SUBMENU_CC_BREAK_ALL_CONF:1"
msgid "Are you certain you wish to discontinue the construction of <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Please note that all progress will be lost, and materials previously contributed will not be returned.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Вы уверены, что хотите прекратить производство: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Весь прогресс будет потерян. Сданные материалы не вернутся.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 製作を中止する
#. de: Projekt abbrechen
#. fr: Interrompre le projet de con<shy>struc<shy>tion
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_SUBMENU_CC_BREAK_ALL_CHECK:1"
msgid "Discontinue project."
msgstr "Прекратить выпуск проекта."

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_SUBMENU_CC_BREAK_YES:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_SUBMENU_CC_BREAK_NO:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Нет"

#. ja: カンパニー製作設備から、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を回収します。<br>よろしいですか？
#. de: Der Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaftswerkstätte <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> entnehmen?
#. fr: Récupérer <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1><nbsp>?
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_FINISH_CONF:1"
msgid "Retrieve <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> from the company workshop?"
msgstr "Забрать <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> из мастерской компании?"

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_FINISH_YES:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "custom/001/CmnDefCompanyManufactory_00150:TEXT_CMNDEFCOMPANYMANUFACTORY_00150_FINISH_NO:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Нет"
